  "content": "<p><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_945056aa-921e-44e4-85dd-f45231940861.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"732\" height=\"316\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/potionstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4bce6dd3-7af5-4014-a705-04cd0c0adb87.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"231\" height=\"44\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/zQA4eez2eS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2e3d72d9-91b0-4d00-8eef-26be28254a6c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"231\" height=\"44\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252f_AOCAWOL\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_84597b2e-8453-472a-9043-329d8218ac75.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"231\" height=\"44\"></a> &nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>“你的头里有大脑，脚上有鞋子。你可以自行选择前往任何方向。你独自一人，知道自己所知，而你就是那个决定去向的人。”</em>&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>——苏斯博士，《哦，你将要去的地方！》</em>&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1070751/description_a1820aba-6e98-496b-954b-53c078297080.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"302\" height=\"71\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wayfinder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1070751/description_f80168f8-5c01-42cf-a924-b36e91cafca5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"594\" height=\"101\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-descent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1070751/description_7acdccbe-8e6f-49f6-bde2-ee820d4370a9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"596\" height=\"68\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1070751/description_10da38ee-7e1c-4d1d-9bf5-d07267b232ad.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"616\" height=\"116\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#930;font-size:18px\">《哦，我们去过的生物群系》是经典模组《哦，你将去的生物群系》的续作，适用于Minecraft 1.20及以上版本，包含超过50个令人叹为观止、神奇而真实的生物群系。BWG将带你踏上冒险之旅，为Minecraft增添丰富而细致的世界。BWG还新增了独特的生物、结构以及数百种可使用的方块。</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#930;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_43d7961e-7fe6-4cab-9073-f96e1a05c5bf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"793\" height=\"416\"></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">寻找1.19及以下版本的版本？请查看<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">《哦，你将去的生物群系》</span></a>！</p>",
